{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a universe full of secrets, you take on the role of a brave astronaut in search of space relics. Explore this vast universe, traverse territories, and dodge asteroids while uncovering rare artifacts lost in the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/extras/ls_one.gif?t=1745438954\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mysteries of the universe in Story Mode or test your reflexes in Infinite Run. Take on three challenging minigames: <i>All Sides</i> tests your reaction time, <i>Planet Hop</i> requires precision, and <i>Zero-Gravity Pool</i> brings strategic challenges in weightlessness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560680/extras/ls_two.gif?t=1745438954\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Embark on an immersive journey through the universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relic Collection</strong> \u2013 Discover and catalog unique space artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Tree</strong> \u2013 Enhance your journey with strategic upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of Skins</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique outfits for your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Challenges</strong> \u2013 Overcome obstacles and prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Territory Exploration</strong> \u2013 Conquer and discover new regions of space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and Achievements</strong> \u2013 Complete objectives and unlock trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Compatible with Xbox 360, Xbox One, Xbox Series X/S, and PlayStation 4/5 (Bluetooth and USB).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Space holds many secrets... are you ready to uncover them?</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Doutorado em Espa\u00e7o Solar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/0849197f206744f6dabc2389b730b9673bbcd166.jpg"},{"name":"Lar, doce lar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/f80016b2599198b4cc186d9f0ac1e51be62992d4.jpg"},{"name":"Colecionador de esferas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/dcf90173e21ffef79a87f62dda363217454fb742.jpg"},{"name":"Colecionador de luzes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/f7031b486d414e1de23424b866a766a489b3256c.jpg"},{"name":"Eu entendi a refer\u00eancia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/b3aff81d67077dfdf628599d96751d0b643497fd.jpg"},{"name":"Desafiante","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/e69e06670bfc4e6b7da8ac8cb1207c1165930965.jpg"},{"name":"Sumiu!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/757338c83a1df7c32313f4898b0b71ca22459911.jpg"},{"name":"Rei do Taco","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/48da67a2aefee8a611e02dd77b8e0326f4dbd375.jpg"},{"name":"Pernamolas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/0b7fc5c7eb6179330c341a1967004c40a832108d.jpg"},{"name":"Ao infinito e al\u00e9m","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560680/5b24e09cc6e30695c824fcb4e29820471408630f.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage